    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>I dare say there are few cooler places to stay in Amsterdam than the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.miauw.com/\">Miauw Suites</a>. Located in \"9 straatjes\", a Soho-like area in City Centre, not only do you have great views of the canal, but you can also sit and watch thousands of bicyclists peddle by your window. The suite we stayed in also had a sink in the bedroom and a shower stall / toilet combo situated in between the bedroom and living room. It might sound strange, but it was pretty suite!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Oh, and for a fun fact, \"miauw\" means \"meow\" in Dutch!</p>"
    },
