    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Amsterdam is known for its canals, so a <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g188590-d2010324-Reviews-Amsterdam_Canal_Cruises-Amsterdam_North_Holland_Province.html\">canal boat ride</a> should definitely be on your itinerary. While some people complain, I actually enjoy doing touristy things. Sometimes it's quite fun to drink a beer and shoot the shit with a tourist from another part of the world that, like you, is super excited to be whereever they are in the world!</p>"
    },
