    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>I have a very clear memory of hanging out in <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.lonelyplanet.com/the-netherlands/amsterdam/attractions/museumplein/a/poi-sig/388127/360839\">Museumplein</a>&nbsp;both times I was in Amsterdam, which is a public space surrounded by several amazing museums. There's something so nice about the sloped corner of the park, which reminds me of the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.designboom.com/architecture/diller-scofidio-renfro-hypar-pavilion/\">Hypar Pavilion</a>, at New York’s Lincoln Center.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>If cheese is your jam, be sure to swing by <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/amsterdam-cheese-company-amsterdam\">Amsterdam Cheese Company</a>. They have lots and lots of samples, and are known for their delicious Dutch gouda. Also, be sure to swing by Amsterdam's famous floating <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.holland.com/global/tourism/destinations/amsterdam/floating-flower-market.htm\">Flower Market</a> (known locally as Bloemenmakrt), which has been in operation since 1862. While I didn't buy any flowers, I did get a couple of fun souveniers there..&nbsp;</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "gallery",
      "columns": 2,
      "images": [
        {
