        {
          "filename": "-13_1.jpg",
          "src_url": "https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/58d6f67f9de4bba5f5e41958/1493777515048-7TVAOMKRFYIAT16OL3P4/-13_1.jpg?format=original"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>I imagine if you ever find yourself in Texas you might say, \"Wow, lots of people here wear cowboy hats.\" Well, similarly, while in Amsterdam you'll undoubtedly notice that almost everyone rides bikes.&nbsp;This is why, when walking around, you definitely need to make sure you're aware of the bike lanes. It's also why you should definitely rent a bike to ride around yourself!</p>\n<p>We rented a couple of cruisers from <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.mikesbiketoursamsterdam.com/\">Mike's Bikes</a>. Unlike riding a bike in other major cities, riding around Amsterdam is extremely fun and relaxing.</p>"
    },
