        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>The <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.annefrank.org/\">Anne Frank Museum</a> is an important place to visit while in Amsterdam. It's situated right on the canal, so sitting and reflecting a little after your visit is pretty convenient, and necessary.&nbsp;</p>"
