    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>For years and years I've thought that FOAM was one of the best and most exciting photography magazines out there. Lucky for me (and you), their <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.foam.org/\">museum</a> in Amsterdam is quite exciting as well! While there we saw an incredible photo series of rural families living in Eastern Europe.&nbsp;</p>"
